# ============================================================
# GOOGLE SHEETS INTEGRATION — REQUIRED CONFIG
# This is how the React app saves form data to your Google Sheet.
#
# TWO things you MUST set:
#
# 1. VITE_SHEETS_WEB_APP_URL
#    This is the Apps Script Web App URL. You get this AFTER
#    deploying the Code.gs file (google-apps-script/Code.gs):
#      a. Open https://script.google.com → New project
#      b. Paste the Code.gs contents (SPREADSHEET_ID is already set
#         to your sheet)
#      c. Set SHARED_SECRET in Code.gs to a random string
#      d. Deploy → New deployment → Web app
#         Execute as: Me | Access: Anyone
#      e. Copy the /exec URL and paste it below
#
# 2. VITE_SHEETS_SHARED_SECRET
#    Must EXACTLY match the SHARED_SECRET constant you set
#    in Code.gs. If they don't match → "Unauthorized request."
#
# Your Google Sheet:
#   https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1KwAI9b8Kvgx_t2V7Tpc4PZJjxkhnGZTZ84a0MMTEsdQ
#   (SPREADSHEET_ID is already hardcoded in google-apps-script/Code.gs)
# ============================================================
VITE_SHEETS_WEB_APP_URL=https://script.google.com/macros/s/PASTE_YOUR_DEPLOYED_URL_HERE/exec
VITE_SHEETS_SHARED_SECRET=PASTE_THE_SAME_SECRET_YOU_SET_IN_CODE.GS

# ============================================================
